    <item>
      <title>Xenia! The Galaxy Angel Cat (Dreamcatcher Set)</title>
      <author>.+MangoMikkii+.</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/733847</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/733847#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">effa3977f79f0b00e673b2d415689fa2419fd8ca</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:21:58 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e6d81e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e69402.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e64862.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e03fc6.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e0abfb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5de5b2d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5dd6c7a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e2c5b7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e32955.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e32f46.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e3670d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae3ee5e36192.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;!!! CAUTION: BEWARE OF SCAMMERS. MY MODS ARE FREE. DO NOT SELL OR CHARGE MONEY FOR "MODDING SERVICES". !!!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;˚　　　　✦　　　.　　. 　 ˚　.　　　　　 . ✦　　　 　˚　　　　 . ★⋆.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/6po3dg.png"&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;　　　.   　　˚　　 　　*　　 　　✦　　　.　　.　　　✦　˚ 　　　　.   　　˚　　 　　*　　 　　&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;u&gt;.+Welcome to Mikki's Galaxy Dreamland!+.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp; ˚ʚ☆ɞ˚ I am the dreamcatcher! collector of stars! ʚ☆ɞ˚&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Soo I decided to make a custom villager! I know i've made the Katie mod before in the past but it was literally just a texture swap. I wanted to make something creative. I've been staying away from villager mods out of fear but after some BIG trail and error I welcome &lt;b&gt;Xenia!!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Comes with custom eyes, galaxy fur, wings &amp;amp; more!!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Xenia the Galaxy Angel Cat!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; She is apart of my fake story game&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;"Galaxia"&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Which will eventually be one bit mod set.&lt;br&gt;---------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;A hybrid of both an angel and a cat send from the heavens as a coronation gift to&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Raja, Prince of Stars.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/b&gt;She is both a pet and a subject to him, but barely listens to his commands or anybody else's for that matter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;She's the dreamcatcher of this generation and teaches Celeste&lt;b&gt; &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;(My OC who got isekai'd into the game)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; how to be a dreamcatcher and collect stars for earth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;But she's a bit of a &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;snooty type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;. Very egotistical, vain, and easily bored. Often wandering from town to town at night because she likes adventure and excitement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If she thinks the town is as beautiful as her, she will live there for while. But she quickly gets bored and jumps to another town.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Because of her profession as a dreamcatcher, she is often seen at night. Since she lives off a diet of only stars and moonlight, she &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;glows in the dark!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Xenia also comes with a custom house &lt;b&gt;(exterior only)&lt;/b&gt; because purple stars remind her of her home planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/644011"&gt;&lt;b&gt;If you want Xenia to have galaxy tools (or all your villagers for that matter) download my Galaxy Tool Set! link here&amp;nbsp;https://gamebanana.com/mods/644011&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;--------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;This mod is an override. Meaning that it will replace the villager that is already in the game. Xenia replaces the "&lt;b&gt;Purrl&lt;/b&gt;" in &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;New Leaf.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Luma &amp;amp; Citra compatible)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;*PLEASE LET ME KNOW IF THERES ANY ISSUES*&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;---------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2F_nAMf5Xobys&amp;amp;follow=true"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Video tutorial now available!) For a written version, use the tutorial inside the zipped folder if you need help on how to install.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;All I ask is that you download this mod for free personal use &lt;b&gt;ONLY&lt;/b&gt;, NOT commercial. &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Do not repost, resell, re-edit, claim ownership, or place behind a paywall.)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;[&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Under Creative Commons License]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Please credit me by linking my mods if you ever use them for screenshots or for your mods.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you so much for shopping at my boutique! Stay glamorous.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;-Mikii&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;---------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;QR Code for in game pics&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://peachesfromparadise.tumblr.com/post/134893383964/changed-the-skirt-on-one-of-my-older-designs" target="_blank"&gt;Pink Sweater Jacket (Made by Peaches in Paradise): link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/77687162319006795/" target="_blank"&gt;Purple Midnight Yukata&amp;nbsp;(Found on Pinterest): link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;---------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;Also a big shoutout to &lt;b&gt;@cxnclled&lt;/b&gt; for helping me figure out why my villager is crashing ur da best &amp;lt;33</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/xenia_galaxy_angel_cat.zip" type="application/zip"/>
