    <item>
      <title>Revised Specular Shaders</title>
      <author>Tojo Subsidiary</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/732699</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/732699#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2a77423494aa4eb04b0bafa14ec4b2cd405934b7</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:14:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae00704c0985.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b268d5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b2a479.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b2b9a4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b2938d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b347bd.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b406ae.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b4d87e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b559b1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b64fc7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b29e4d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b40d76.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b2f4e8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae0073b41cf4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;A mod for Animal Crossing New Leaf to replace the landscape shaders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A LayeredFS mod replacing landscape models with custom TEV Combiners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I am not good at writing descriptions. The 3DS supports "Blinn-Phong" a cheap lighting model for specularity reflections. Animal Crossing New Leaf supports this, using LUT textures to remap it similar to TF2 lightwarps. This mod changes the equation of landscape shading a bit and updates the LUTs. This will be incompatible with similar mods, but really, are there any others?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Credit to &lt;a href="https://github.com/MapStudioProject/CTR-Studio" target="_blank"&gt;CTR Studio&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for making such a robust TEV editor!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;AI Disclosure&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;No AI has been used for the mod itself.&lt;/b&gt; A simple replacer script to batch replace the shader with an edited one was used, generated by Free Claude (If you pay for this you are a silly silly person.)&lt;br&gt;This is the extent of 'AI' used for the mod, simply due to missing support in CTR Studio to batch it. While I could program it myself, time saving so I can get back to projects I want to do was more important.</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/rss_6dbbf.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <category>Skins</category>
      <category>Skins</category>
    </item>
