ebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adbc3989a173.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adbc41d0dcad.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adbc52577ef6.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adbc5561bf04.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adbc57484105.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adbc5849176a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adbc62034b47.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adbc632965b4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/u8n0e9.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;♡ &lt;a href="https://discord.gg/ZdFazKAkpy" target="_blank"&gt;Click here to join my discord server for modding help, mod work in progress pics, mod requests and more! &lt;/a&gt;♡&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                    ㅤㅤ  ㅤ&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/olqv20.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/tbxprh.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;ㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤ&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt; In celebration of my birthday for 2026 &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;After almost 4 months of work, it's finally here! This is by far my ultimate, favourite and largest project to date— The Dollhouse Dreams mod pack.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Dollhouse Dreams mod pack contains A LOT of content however, some of the items that I have released individually are missing from the main zipped folder, if you want any of those, you will need to download them individually instead of inside the mod pack like my previous projects, this is because some of the accessories I've made uses the same accessory and conflicts. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Dollhouse Dreams mod pack contains the following:&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Dreamy Town Tree&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Delicate Town Hall - &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;replaces the fairy-tale town hall &lt;u&gt;only&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Dreamy Flower Clock&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Dreamy Flower Arch - &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;has no snow on top during the winter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Princess Curls - &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;replaces tiara wig / uses reworked bangs ver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Cupcake Curls - &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;replaces bun wig / uses bangs ver.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Strawberry Shortcake Twintails - &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;replaces geisha wig / &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;uses remastered ver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Rosy Ribbon Puffs -&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt; replaces regent wig / &lt;u&gt;not &lt;/u&gt;colour compatible - uses edges ver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Wispy Side Ponytail - &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;replaces hair-bow wig / uses geisha wig ver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Candy Floss Trees -&lt;b&gt; &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;replaces both hardwood &amp; fruit trees all year round&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams  - Dreamy Flower Recolours - &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;replaces black/white/pink tulips, red carnations and black roses&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Christmas Lights Recolours - &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Requested by детектив пломбир (xorsot) in my Discord server (thankyou for the request and beautiful suggestion!)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Dropped Heart Crystal - &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;replaces bunny day winning ticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Dollhouse Dreams mod pack has these additional accessories ready for you to download individually here (click on the names to preview the mod pages):&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/715839"&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Cupcake Curls Lacey Ribbon Accessory (v3/v4 in the downloads tab)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/727497"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Rosy Ribbon Puffs Accessory (v3 in the downloads tab)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/730894"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Kawaii Hair Bows - 13 colours to choose from!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;ㅤㅤ&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;ㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤ&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡ 3DS: ✓ | Emulator: ✓ &lt;/span&gt;♡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                          &lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/isgx7t.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vapecord IDs: &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;2891&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;- Geisha wig (for Strawberry Twintails wig)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;28cf &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;- Hair-Bow wig (for Wispy Side Ponytail wig)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;2895 &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;- Regent wig ( for Rosy Ribbon Puffs wig)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;2898 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;- Bun wig (for Cupcake Curls wig)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;2899 &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;- Tiara wig (for Princess Curls wig)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;211c &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;- winning ticket (for Dropped Heart crystal)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;2910 &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;- HMD (for the Rosy Ribbon puffs/Cupcake Curls/Kawaii Hair Bo