      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aad7169ecd5a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aad780a1ed4e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aad780aed332.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad680066d19e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; ADDED XMAS LIGHT RECOLOURS TO ALL FLORA&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: added xmas lights recolours to all flora + transparent paths&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/u8n0e9.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;♡ &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2FZdFazKAkpy&amp;follow=true"&gt;Join my discord server for modding help, mod work in progress pics, mod requests and more!&lt;/a&gt; ♡&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                    ㅤㅤ  ㅤ&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/olqv20.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;ㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤ&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Celebrating my birthday for 2026 !!!&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod modifies the trees, flowers and in game paths for transparency. It makes the leaves on both normal and fruit trees into light sakura petals all year round. In addition to that, some of the in game flowers have been edited to be a beautiful less saturated pink colour.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;NEW!:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt; As of 19/10/2026 a new addition has been added that edits the colours of the xmas lights on cedar trees to pink and white. Thank you to детектив пломбир (xorsot) in my discord server for this mod request!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤ&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡3DS: ✓ | Emulator: ✓ &lt;/span&gt;♡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Black tulips have been replaced with the dollhouse dreams pink recolour.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pink tulips have been replaced witht the heavenly cupid light pink colour.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;White tulips are half dollhouse dreams pink and half white. (You can think of this one as the remix of the original heavenly cupid one from that mod pack).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Red carnations have been replaced with the dollhouse dreams pink recolour.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Black roses have been replaced with the dollhouse dreams pink recolour as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;NEW! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;Cedar trees that have the xmas lights on during the festive period (or spawned in) now have  pink and white recolours! Thank you to детектив пломбир (xorsot) in my discord server for this mod request!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/699211"&gt;transparency mod by CristataWolf&lt;/a&gt; has been made compatiable with this mod, I followed CristataWolf's tutorial included in their mod's zipped folder to make it compitable with this flora mod as they unfortunately use the same modding directory with files being SeasonsXX; please refer to their mod's page on more information about the mod and how it works. &lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;However&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, if CristataWolf wishes for me to remove this mod from being included in this mod/mod pack I will respect that and remove it. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod looks better when paired with the &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/717082"&gt;Dollhouse Dreams - Dreamy Town Tree mod&lt;/a&gt; which will be included in the mod pack or you can download it seperately.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/do9i0h.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;CONFLICTING MODS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod will conflict with anything in &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/cats/43264"&gt;&lt;u&gt;this modding category&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                           &lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/isgx7t.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Installation instructions can be found &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkikifrommeadow.com%2F2026%2F06%2F12%2Fhow-to-create-texture-mods-for-animal-crossing-new-leaf%2F&amp;follow=true"&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please do &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; reupload my mods without my permission, this includes but not limited to: reposting/reuploading, editing/modifying, put under a paywall/reselling and/or claim ownership of my mods. This all falls under the Creative Commons License. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If there are any issues please don't hestitate to contact me via Tumblr DMS &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkikifrommeadow.tumblr.com%2F&amp;follow=true"&gt;kikifrommeadow&lt;/a&gt; or alternatively comment under this post, I'll try and get back to you ASAP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;  If you use my mods please tag me on social media so I can see ! I'd love to see your gameplay with my creations!&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/umflbu.png"&gt;</description>
