      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:35:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad8034a6aae2.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad803526b68d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad803585cf45.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad8035ee80af.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6adc03c293be0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/e3pqio.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                          a  mangomikii x cxnclled_ collaboration!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A massive, &lt;b&gt;MASSIVE&lt;/b&gt; selection of all sorts of animal ears! From fox ears, bunny, deer, dog, cat to kitsune. &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;There's 7 types of ear species, 4 style categories, a bunch of colors, and over over 50 items in total.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; It is &lt;b&gt;STACKED.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Multiple different styles in here too. From Cute, Punk/Gothic, Colorful and Natural. All custom made by the both of us. Comes with tails too!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In collaboration with &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/3715646"&gt;@mangomikii&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; we are so happy to finally announce the Adorkable Animal Ears mod! We both worked on this together and I'm so happy to release it to all of you!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod is an override, meaning it will replace the items already in the game. This mod set replaces the majority of the &lt;b&gt;"feathers"&lt;/b&gt; Look below!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;REPLACEMENTS (By Species)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;---------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pointy Cat/Wolf Ears: Replaces Red Feather&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Round Cat Ears: Replaces Yellow Feather&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bunny Ears: Replaces Green Feather&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Floppy Bunny Ears: Replaces White Feather&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deer Ears: Replaces Blue Feather&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dog Ears: Replaces Purple Feather&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kitsune Ears: Replaces Rainbow Feather&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kitsune Tail: Replaces Kings Beard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;--------------------------------------- &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;There are 4 categories. The category you pick all comes in a set. &lt;b&gt;Only pick ONE SET&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;COLORS (By Category)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;--------------------------------------- &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Cute (7 Items) | Colorful (7 Items) | Punk (7 Items) | Natural (32 Items) &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;--------------------------------------- &lt;br&gt;For free personal use &lt;b&gt;ONLY&lt;/b&gt;, NOT commercial. &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Do not repost, resell, re-edit, claim ownership, or place behind a paywall.)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;[&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Under Creative Commons License]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;CREDITS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Concept created by cxnclled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mod made by cxnclled &amp; MangoMikii&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colors made by cxnclled &amp; MangoMikii&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Thumbnails created by MangoMikii&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Preview In-game Pictures captured by cxnclled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mods Used (w links)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/3715646"&gt;.+MangoMikkii+.&lt;/a&gt; Mods&lt;br&gt;------------------------------------------------&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/644019"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/644019"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/644019"&gt;&lt;font color="#ffe033"&gt;&lt;b&gt;⟡ Galaxia Face ⟡ (Unisex) by MangoMikii&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/730203"&gt;&lt;b&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; https://gamebanana.com/mods/730203&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color="#fd70e1"&gt;&lt;b&gt;ʚɞ Smol Bean Face ʚɞ by &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b&gt;MangoMikii&lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/710607"&gt;&lt;b&gt;: &lt;/b&gt;https://gamebanana.com/mods/710607&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/644019"&gt;&lt;b&gt;⁺₊✧Lunar Lullaby Locks⁺₊✧ by &lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;MangoMikii&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; https://gamebanana.com/mods/644019&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/662445"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strider Unmasked Wig by &lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;MangoMikii&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;: &lt;/b&gt;https://gamebanana.com/mods/662445&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/722967"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Forever Essential Skin Tones by &lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;MangoMikii&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;: &lt;/b&gt;https://gamebanana.com/mods/722967&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/1764570"&gt;UsagiDahlia&lt;/a&gt; Mods&lt;br&gt;------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/663565"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colorful Uniforms Mod by UsagiDahlia:&lt;/b&gt; https://gamebanana.com/mods/663565&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
