r"&gt;One for the boy avatar and one for the girl avatar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Since they are two different files entirely.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is compatible with &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;ALL SKINTONES IN THE GAME.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; As well as &lt;b&gt;modded skintones&lt;/b&gt; as well. I added versions of my&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/722967"&gt; "Forever Essentials Skin Tone Mod"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;. Select the version that you picked for the game.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This face mod is an override. Meaning that it will replace the item that is already in the game. &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Look at the photo inside of the mod to find the face that you need to use for this mod.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;(Luma &amp; Citra compatible)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2F_nAMf5Xobys&amp;follow=true"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Video tutorial now available!) For a written version, use the tutorial inside the zipped folder if you need help on how to install.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;All I ask is that you download this mod for free personal use &lt;b&gt;ONLY&lt;/b&gt;, NOT commercial. &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Do not repost, resell, re-edit, claim ownership, or place behind a paywall.)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;[&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Under Creative Commons License]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; (Please credit me by linking my mods if you ever use them for screenshots or for your mods.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you for shopping at my boutique! Stay glamorous.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;-Mikii&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;Other Mods Used&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/722967"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Forever Essential Skin Tones: &lt;/b&gt;https://gamebanana.com/mods/722967&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/595080"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Wolfsbane Cut (Unisex): &lt;/b&gt;https://gamebanana.com/mods/595080&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;Celeste's Wig &amp; Accessory:&lt;/b&gt; Will be released soon.&lt;br&gt;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;</description>
