udes but not limited to: reposting/reuploading, editing/modifying, put under a paywall/reselling and/or claim ownership of my mods. This all falls under the Creative Commons License.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If there are any issues please don't hestitate to contact me via Tumblr DMS &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkikifrommeadow.tumblr.com%2F&amp;amp;follow=true"&gt;kikifrommeadow&lt;/a&gt; or alternatively comment under this post, I'll try and get back to you ASAP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; If you use my mods please tag me on social media so I can see ! I'd love to see your gameplay with my creations!&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/umflbu.png"&gt;</description>
