      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abee6330fb9c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abee63336394.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abee6320e5d4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abee6352b703.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; For ALL Regions/Countries&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This mod can be used for &lt;strong&gt;ALL&lt;/strong&gt; region countries. &lt;strong&gt;(USA/EU/JPN/KOR)&lt;/strong&gt; etc. There is no limitation. However if you have a JPN game you MUST change the name to &lt;strong&gt;"RomFS"&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: Can be Used for ALL regions&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;!!! CAUTION: BEWARE OF SCAMMERS. MY MODS ARE FREE. DO NOT SELL OR CHARGE MONEY FOR "MODDING SERVICES". !!!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;˚　　　　✦　　　.　　. 　 ˚　.　　　　　 . ✦　　　 　˚　　　　 . ★⋆.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;　　　.   　　˚　　 　　*　　 　　✦　　　.　　.　　　✦　˚&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/b439ea322324c9f9224c342c106e8a3b/e0e80e4da4831aed-1d/s2048x3072/95ca21a1c99c378a8989b5e50cbb6757b19258de.gif" width="65%" class="SelectedElement"&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;　　　.   　　˚　　 　　*　　 　　✦　　　.　　.　　　✦　˚ 　　　　.   　　˚　　 　　*　　 　　✦　　　.　　.　　　✦　˚ 　　　　 ˚　.˚　　　　　　.　　. 　 ˚　.　　 　　　　 ✦&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;u&gt;.+Welcome to Mikki's Boutique!+.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp; ˚ʚ♡ɞ˚ it's been 15 years...&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;˚ʚ♡ɞ˚&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; a&amp;nbsp; mangomikii x cxnclled_ collaboration!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This has been overdue for a long &lt;b&gt;LONG &lt;/b&gt;time. For almost a decade, people have been swimming in shark infested waters for hours on end just to get a tan that fades in 3 days. Or they've been sticking their game saves in cheats with no permanent solution. &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;That ends today!!!!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In collaboration with&lt;b&gt; &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/5904578"&gt;@cxnclled_&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; we are so happy to finally announce a &lt;b&gt;PERMANENT SKIN MOD!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;**Please look at all thumbnail photos to pick which skin tone you want**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 custom natural skin tones that will never,&lt;b&gt; EVER&lt;/b&gt; fade no matter what happens. You can time travel, leave your game idle, and do whatever.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;There are some minor issues however. &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;PLEASE READ THE FOLLOWING DOWN BELOW:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Compatibility (Everything that WORKS):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Permanent skin tone:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Meaning &lt;b&gt;nothing&lt;/b&gt; will stop it from fading away, regardless of what skin you choose&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Custom Skin Tones:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Since this mod required 630+ files to be edited I could only go with 5 skin shades for my own sanity. I tried my best to make it as inclusive as possible. 100% custom made by a fellow poc (me!)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;100% Unisex:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; For all avatars, hair colors, and vanilla faces. Anybody can use it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;For 3DS &amp;amp; Emulator:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Compatible &amp;amp; tested for the 3DS and emulators such as Azahar, Lime3DS, Citra etc.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Light on devices:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; It shouldn't cause your game to crash, brick, lag, or lose performance. Your device will be fine&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Can be used with other mods:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; 100% Mod compatible UNLESS stated or has something to do with editing skin (etc: face mods that aren't updated)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;================================================================&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Known Issues (Minor aesthetic issues or NO compatibility)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;You CANNOT change your eye color with this mod installed:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; it will permanently be black (due to the pngs in vanilla being black by default.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;There may be SOME pixelated area's in the face:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;I tried my best to manually fix them, this is just a slight pet peeve, it'll work just fine if you don't care.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Unless stated, this will not work with most face mods:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; I edited my "lil smol bean" face mod for this. But other than that others won't work. Vanilla faces are 100% compatible.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;SOME dark grey color clothing will appear brown: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;I have no idea why it does this. you'll see what I mean but it shouldn't cause a major issue.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;==========================================================&lt;br&gt;This is a massive mod that overrides over &lt;b&gt;600 player files&lt;/b&gt;, it will replace your skin tone and will not fade or tan. &lt;b&gt;Read the .txt file VERY carefully.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;IF YOU WANT TO CHANGE YOUR SKIN COLOR:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Just download the new skin tone you want and dump it into your game, you can continue to do this for as long as you want. IT WILL REPLACE ALL AVATAR SKIN TONES INCLUDING OTHER PLAYERS.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;IF YOU NO LONGER WANT THE SKIN MOD/BACK TO VANILLA:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Delete the "Player" file by going in the "romfs" folder, it will delete everything.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;There are 5 "Natural" Shades. &lt;b&gt;ONLY DOWNLOAD ONE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Colors (From lightest to darkest)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cream | Butter | Honey | Chai | Hazelnut |&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;========================================================&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2F_nAMf5Xobys&amp;amp;follow=true"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Video tutorial now available!) For a written version, use the tutorial inside the zipped folder if you need help on how to install.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;All I ask is that you download this mod for free personal use &lt;b&gt;ONLY&lt;/b&gt;, NOT commercial. &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Do not repost, resell, re-edit, claim ownership, or place behind a paywall.)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;[&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Under Creative Commons License]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Please credit me by linking my mods if you ever use them for screenshots or for your mods.)&lt;br&gt;===========================================================================&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;!!ABOUT MULTIPLAYER!!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you plan to use this while playing with others, such as Pretendo. &lt;b&gt;You and the people you are playing with must both have the skin mod installed&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;HOWEVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The skin tone you use will show on all other players. For example, If you pick Chai, and the person you're playing with picks Hazelnut, everyone's skin will be Chai on your end, and everyone's skin will be Hazelnut on the other players side.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;(YOU CAN STILL USE THE MOD IN MULTIPLAYER, IT WON'T CRASH OR GLITCH YOUR GAME)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;==============================================================================&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;!!CAN BE USED FOR ALL REGIONS!!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I forgot to add this but it's important. This mod can be used for &lt;b&gt;ALL&lt;/b&gt; region countries. &lt;b&gt;(USA/EU/JPN/KOR)&lt;/b&gt; etc. There is no limitation. However if you have a JPN game you MUST change the name to &lt;b&gt;"RomFS"&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;==============================================================================&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;**The hairstyles used in the thumbnails are my mods, since there's too many on here to link directly, please visit my mod page using the link below to download them on my profile.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
