      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aceaa22b4f27.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aceb03433cdf.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/u8n0e9.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;♡ &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2FZdFazKAkpy&amp;follow=true"&gt;Join my discord server for modding help, mod work in progress pics, mod requests and more!&lt;/a&gt; ♡&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                    ㅤㅤ  ㅤ&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/olqv20.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤ&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Celebrating my birthday for 2026 !!!&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Animal Crossing: New Leaf is severely lacking when it comes to representation for POC hairstyles so when I saw &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/projects/37731"&gt;Scol1pede's project&lt;/a&gt; (previously known as leuk0) which mentioned adding inclusive hairstyles and seeing my friend &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/4638882"&gt;IdyllicPixie &lt;/a&gt;create her POC hairstyle from that project I also became inspired to create my own, so introducing my POC Rosy Ribbons Puffs wig! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The ribbons (officially known as: Rosy Ribbons Accessory) are a separate accessory that are included within the mod or you can download it separately.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod modifies the regent wig! This &lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;IS &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;my first ever attempt at making a POC hairstyle/wig mod so any feedback is greatly welcome so I can be as accurate as possible! &lt;3&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ㅤㅤ&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;♡ In-game colour compatible: ✗ | 3DS: ✓ | Emulator: ✓ &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;♡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                          &lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/isgx7t.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#ff4e4e"&gt;&lt;b&gt;This mod is &lt;u&gt;NOT colour &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;compatible!&lt;/u&gt; I can make different hair colour versions if requested but the default colour is black! Please feel free to suggest any hair colour with any hex colour!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/do9i0h.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vapecord IDs: &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;♡ &lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;2895 &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;- Regent Wig&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;♡ &lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;2910 &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;- HMD (for the ribbons accessory)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;                          &lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/isgx7t.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;CONFLICTING MODS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod will conflict with any mod that uses the bun wig - "hlmt_wig_regent.bcres" and the HMD accessory "acc_HMD.bcres". It conflicts with my previously published work:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/715839"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cupcake Curls Lacey Accessory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; - (for HMD)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/do9i0h.png"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please read the installation instructions&lt;u&gt; &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkikifrommeadow.com%2F2025%2F12%2F31%2Fhow-to-install-my-mods-for-animal-crossing-new-leaf%2F&amp;follow=true" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;here&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please do &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; reupload my mods without my permission, this includes but not limited to: reposting/reuploading, editing/modifying, put under a paywall/reselling and/or claim ownership of my mods. This all falls under the Creative Commons License. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If there are any issues please don't hestitate to contact me via Tumblr DMS &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkikifrommeadow.tumblr.com%2F&amp;follow=true"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;kikifrommeadow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; or alternatively comment under this post, I'll try and get back to you ASAP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡ &lt;/span&gt;If you use my mods please tag me on social media so I can see! I'd love to see your gameplay with my creations!&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;♡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.catbox.moe/umflbu.png"&gt;</description>
